      "title": "Rupee extends rally for fifth consecutive session as crude, dollar soften",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/economy/news/rupee-extends-rally-for-fifth-consecutive-session-as-crude-dollar-soften-126101501313_1.html",
      "description": "The rupee gained for a fifth straight session to close at 95.06 against the dollar as crude oil prices and US yields eased, while forward premiums surged on FERR-related unwinding",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
